 "conclusions": [
  "Structure is learned: contrast recovery slope median >= 0.998 for moderate/high contrast in test, 0.996 in ood_contrast (span 2.5-3.0); bias is 8.6% of test MSE (lwd_v1: 33%).",
  "Error concentrates on interfaces: debiased RMSE 0.071 within 2 cells of an interface vs 0.013 elsewhere; 25% of cells are interface cells.",
  "Thin dense layering (median < 1 ft, layers down to 0.2 ft = 2.4 cells, below the 8-cell latent stride) drives most of the error; this supports lwd_v3.",
  "Thick beds keep a 0.020 log10 mean absolute global offset (debiased RMSE 0.006).",
